// WorldTwoTextureBlend (worldtwotextureblend_ps20b / lightmappedgeneric_vs20):
// base texture blended with (or masked by) a detail texture, times the
// lightmap (sampler 1 on uv1) and 2x overbright, with self-illumination, vertex
// color, bumped lightmaps (uv2 steps the three bumped pages) and seamless
// mapping. Varied texels make every term visible. The SELFILLUM,
// DETAIL_ALPHA_MASK_BASE_TEXTURE and BUMPMAP combos are in
// retail/worldtwotextureblend_skipped_combos.vdf: this tree's .fxc skips them.
